## Execution sequence

1. Receive workflow input.
2. Build agent context.
3. Load selected model.
4. Load relevant memory.
5. Resolve connected tool schemas.
6. Call the model.
7. Detect valid tool requests.
8. Validate tool arguments.
9. Execute authorized tools.
10. Return results to the model.
11. Continue within configured iteration limits.
12. Apply output parsing.
13. Return final result.

